{"productId": "652111e6-72ec-4d89-9190-6692010dc1c6", "modelName": "600 American", "modelDescription": "The CZ 600 AMERICAN is a modern, American-style bolt-action centerfire rifle that\u2019s equipped with a beautifully crafted Turkish walnut stock with a fleur-de-lis on the grip. Available in a wide range of calibers, from 223 Rem. to 300 Win. Mag., it is ready to meet the needs of a wide range of hunters and sport shooters. Like most centerfire rifles in the CZ 600 series, the CZ 600 AMERICAN features a patented vertical safety with intuitive, and virtually noiseless, operation. The bolt can be removed by pressing a spring-loaded button on the right side of the receiver without having to disengage the safety and manipulate the trigger. The controlled feed system with short extractor ensures reliable delivery of cartridges in any position, even during rapid reloads.", "manufacturerName": "CZ-USA", "subProducts": [{"isFirearm": true, "isNfa": false, "subProductId": "150bc7f7-251d-43cc-b54a-48064c576922", "description": "CZ-USA, 600 American, Bolt Action, 6.5 Creedmoor, 24\" Threaded Barrel, Black Finish, A Grade Dark Walnut Stock, Right Hand, 5 Round Capacity", "imageUrls": ["https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/7926622d-0b9f-4857-9aa5-edad34fa3893", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/9a575eb3-12bd-4834-b541-5a764976b5e6", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/f4887210-b8e6-4856-b447-ef92679b7f8e", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/034e647d-21f3-43f5-98b5-a9bbb2daf2e4", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/85df5dfe-f971-43d0-a04e-ceb2d39888da"], "isDefault": false, "manufacturerPartNumber": "07717", "upc": "806703077178", "attributes": [{"attributeNameId": "2765db68-a9f0-406d-8fb7-5b572b01f4ee", "attributeName": "Capacity", "attributeValueId": "89787147-cffc-4da1-8117-39428f54fd75", "valueName": "5 Round"}, {"attributeNameId": "7c11c5f3-970e-4119-9b86-521429f6df57", "attributeName": "Stock Typ